      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "story",
      "items": [
        "Then the fat eagle said, 'I must save that white eagle.'"
      ],
      "audioPaths": [
        "audio/lesson-56_c12_i0_then-the-fat-eagle-s.mp3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "story",
      "items": [
        "So he jumped down. he came down on the tiger like a fat rock."
